(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 242.57 155.702 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3c42c939-7622-43ea-866b-106a583d4ea7"))
(text "J23 E-stop feed -> SMDJ36CA TVS -> LM74700-Q1 ideal diode + BSC070N10NS5\n(reverse battery to -65 V) -> VBAT_ESTOP_PRE: E-stop status sense (R251 ->\nU34), trip driver bias (R400). Rail cut TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 2 mOhm\n(trip 15.8/20/24.8 A), latch-off (100k across C_TMR), enabled by WD_OK AND\nESTOP_OK AND RC_ALLOW (74LVC1G11) -> VBAT_ESTOP: engine slot (fuel/crank/glow)\nand ADC readback R411. Re-arm after a trip: firmware toggles RC_ALLOW (PB7).\nSwitched bleeder: RC_EN low -> AO3400A off -> IRLML0100 gate to +5V_TRIP ->\n1.1k (2x 2.2k 2512 1 W) on VBAT_ESTOP: tau ~2 ms, 32 V -> 2 V in <= 6.6 ms;\nstuck-on rail-cut FETs at 32 V = 0.47 W per resistor. Replaces Q70/Q71\nSQD40P10-40L, D137, R627." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f9d382fe-c95b-424e-8ffc-cfa7b8301cd6"))
(embedded_fonts no))
